  "description": "marqius-wkhtmltopdf, the maintained drop-in replacement for wkhtmltopdf, for Windows, Linux and macOS in one package. Wkhtmltopdf.Path gives the program's path for Rotativa, NReco.PdfGenerator, Wkhtmltopdf.NetCore or any library that runs wkhtmltopdf; Marqius.DinkToPdf builds on it for DinkToPdf's API. Same options and output as wkhtmltopdf 0.12.6, with no Qt, no libwkhtmltox and no X server. Commercial, with a 30-day free trial; free for personal, teaching and open-source use.",
